[8.779504, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  Receipt date: Jan 15  |  CSV date: Jan 18  |  Gap: 3 days\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;33m  Default ±2 day margin will MISS this transaction\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;33m  Matching algo will widen the date range to find it\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
